  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the point of intersection of the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is a conic, whose eccentricity is"
  },
