  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The point of intersection of the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>48</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Which is a hyperbola.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>48</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
